    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/prime-education-learning/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Prime Education Learning Theme is a comprehensive and versatile solution tailored for schools, tutors, online academies, and educational institutions, as well as e-learning platforms, coaching centers, vocational training institutes, and various college courses. It effectively supports students in managing classroom learning, blended setups, or digital-first models by facilitating structured online education systems for skill development, certification programs, and professional workshops. The design emphasizes courses, curriculums, teaching resources, and certificates through modern layouts and interactive elements. With features like learning management system (LMS) integration, video lessons, quizzes, and modules, it fosters an engaging online training environment. Additionally, it enables progress tracking, student management, and resource sharing. Fully responsive and SEO-optimized, this theme ensures accessibility across all devices, enhancing visibility for educators, institutions, and online platforms aiming to establish a strong digital presence in education."
    },
